Package: survfcbf
Title: Fast Correlation-Based Filter Feature Selection for Survival Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Carlos", "Fernandez-Lozano",
           email = "carlos.fernandez@udc.es",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0413-5677"))
Description: Adapts the fast correlation-based filter (FCBF) of Yu and Liu
    (2004) <https://www.jmlr.org/papers/v5/yu04a.html> to right-censored
    survival data. Features are ranked by symmetrical uncertainty with the
    martingale residuals of a covariate-free Cox model, the target used for
    information-theoretic filters in the benchmark of Bommert et al. (2021)
    <doi:10.1093/bib/bbab354>, and pruned by approximate Markov blankets.
    Provides the filter together with a leakage-safe nested cross-validation
    harness, a survival data simulator with known cluster-level ground truth,
    and wrappers for standard filter baselines.
